# ============================================================
# GSAT-FE — Apache config (public/)
#
# index.html is the login page, so /public/ lands there.
#
# Do NOT block inc/ here. Those partials are not includes that run
# on the server — every page fetches them over HTTP with
# GSATInclude(), so they have to stay publicly readable or the
# sidebar, topbar and stylesheets never load.
# ============================================================

DirectoryIndex index.html

Options -Indexes
